    text: "Affected direction: Eastbound\r\n\nAffected eastbound trips:\r\n6:45 am from Union Station Track 1 to Denver Airport Station\r\n7:15 am from Union Station Track 1 to Denver Airport Station\r\n7:45 am from Union Station Track 1 to Denver Airport Station\r\n8:15 am from Union Station Track 1 to Denver Airport Station\r\n8:45 am from Union Station Track 1 to Denver Airport Station\r\n9:15 am from Union Station Track 1 to Denver Airport Station\r\n9:45 am from Union Station Track 1 to Denver Airport Station\r\n10:15 am from Union Station Track 1 to Denver Airport Station\r\n10:45 am from Union Station Track 1 to Denver Airport Station\r\n11:15 am from Union Station Track 1 to Denver Airport Station\r\n11:45 am from Union Station Track 1 to Denver Airport Station\r\n12:15 pm from Union Station Track 1 to Denver Airport Station\r\n12:45 pm from Union Station Track 1 to Denver Airport Station"
